 to be zero.  \n(b) Now if the mass at vertex A is doubled then  \n![](_page_4_Diagram_18.jpeg)  \n> **Figure Description (llava:latest):**", chunk_id:"c6461281d372bdebecc17bebe018de92", next_chunk_id:"0ee1387c79408f69ea9a9d795ffe6d6a"}}, {_id:804, properties:{text_embedding:[-0.030372772365808487, -0.0037750836927443743, -0.005686786025762558, -0.053204815834760666, 0.0072539569810032845, -0.06487379223108292, -0.007934416644275188, 0.01277957297861576, 0.028974220156669617, -0.002179647795855999, -0.021485870704054832, 0.008558910340070724, -0.012799622491002083, 0.019825443625450134, -0.025016456842422485, 0.03251116722822189, 0.011467902921140194, 0.0037230676971375942, 0.017054341733455658, -0.01172668393701315, -0.037257205694913864, -0.00715921213850379, -0.024726321920752525, 0.009943489916622639, -0.0012680283980444074, 0.02327924594283104, -0.007687876001000404, 0.027959883213043213, 0.018983036279678345, 0.019914278760552406, 0.06377918273210526, -0.021217292174696922, 0.036424558609724045, -0.04025234282016754, 0.030284367501735687, 0.004244192503392696, -0.020036229863762856, -0.02104167453944683, -0.0392959788441658, 0.06272700428962708, 0.001491232542321086, -0.03867720440030098, 0.03498459607362747, -0.028347451239824295, -0.015380734577775002, -0.036297861486673355, -0.023217281326651573, -0.0348026268184185, -0.02593095228075981, -0.03001946397125721, -0.026298513635993004, -0.03819449245929718, 0.050768185406923294, 0.036497391760349274, 0.02840922400355339, 0.008965685963630676, -0.05032018944621086, -0.044230904430150986, -0.06365565210580826, -0.04166729748249054, -0.007932217791676521, 0.04336927458643913, -0.05801713839173317, -0.06225478649139404, 0.041520118713378906, 0.03947324678301811, 0.021114632487297058, 0.027370810508728027, -0.026848291978240013, -0.034592270851135254, 0.025993475690484047, 0.03921440243721008, -0.011460768058896065, 0.028157664462924004, -0.030527452006936073, 0.043688662350177765, -0.048579439520835876, -0.0225665