we associate a potential energy  $W(h)$  at a point at a height  $h$  above the surface such that  \n$$W(h) = mgh + W_0 \\quad (7.21)$$  \n(where  $W_0$  = constant); then it is clear that  \n$$W_{12} = W(h_2) - W(h_1) \\quad (7.22)$$", chunk_id:"7c40997f79515711ba6d0a31b647b787", next_chunk_id:"7d259d01c4a340264528020e9bebf29a"}}, {_id:825, properties:{text_embedding:[0.015194455161690712, 0.025862084701657295, 0.003992073237895966, -0.006173562258481979, 0.005148694850504398, -0.09831554442644119, 0.029131921008229256, 0.015659481287002563, -0.0017664440674707294, 0.009613355621695518, -0.023935211822390556, 0.01874944195151329, -0.0011403700336813927, -0.01727030985057354, 1.8947063654195517E-4, 0.06405454874038696, 0.022492917254567146, -0.010871006175875664, 0.014479937963187695, 0.010318216867744923, -0.03151257708668709, -0.017782459035515785, 0.013995390385389328, -0.0022220569662749767, 0.0022198616061359644, 0.0214400514960289, 0.008780569769442081, 0.01564202643930912, 0.02036316692829132, 0.042166613042354584, -0.008875361643731594, -0.03475044295191765, 0.004806826822459698, -0.07581339031457901, -0.026587627828121185, 0.0021052274387329817, -0.013428043574094772, -0.02350015752017498, -0.035660769790410995, 0.011322993785142899, -0.02847711741924286, -0.01823541522026062, 0.030071670189499855, -0.007872790098190308, 0.005221464671194553, -0.04188479483127594, -0.05385414510965347, -0.04921058192849159, -0.041638586670160294, -0.05285321921110153, -0.02911284938454628, -0.02898254618048668, 0.0553126186132431, 0.0018536875722929835, 0.008204006589949131, -0.009249309077858925, -0.07740660756826401, -0.01156871672719717, -0.048760876059532166, -0.011923173442482948, 0.007913755252957344, 0.04212137311697006, -0.028567545115947723, -0.017756212502717972, 6.53735245577991E-4, 0.019451897591352463, 0.0031973638106137514, 0.012343010865151882, -0.02151934988796711, -0.03323947638273239, -0.0031076150480657816, 0.04233437031507492, 0.012293441221117973, 0.003