of *M* is  \n$$E_i = \\frac{1}{2} m v^2 - \\frac{G M m}{R} - \\frac{4 G M m}{5 R}.$$  \nAt the neutral point N, the speed approaches zero. The mechanical energy at N is purely potential.  \n$$E_N = -\\frac{G M m}{2R} - \\frac{4 G M m}{4R}.$$  \nFrom the principle of conservation of mechanical energy  \n| $\\frac{1}{2}v^2 - \\frac{GM}{R} - \\frac{4GM}{5R} = -\\frac{GM}{2R} - \\frac{GM}{R}$ |\n|----------------------------------------------------------------------------------|\n|                                                                                  |  \nor", chunk_id:"e5a30dddd31fac8c6434faf78b86fc7f", next_chunk_id:"e97522b63b642a4cae2a9ef8f3146b7f"}}, {_id:840, properties:{text_embedding:[0.031723834574222565, 0.024272769689559937, -0.028362857177853584, 0.01959252916276455, -0.0345400795340538, -0.03244495764374733, 0.0025293705984950066, 0.010594133287668228, -0.0031376013066619635, 0.025183510035276413, -0.04624604061245918, 0.007750804536044598, 0.004862934350967407, -0.024195659905672073, 0.038925547152757645, 0.022324007004499435, 0.010156664997339249, 0.0018897062400355935, 0.04821883887052536, -0.02145085670053959, 0.013260935433208942, 0.05141894891858101, -0.0235418900847435, -0.021365100517868996, 0.019284458830952644, 0.002386475447565317, -0.042604390531778336, 0.011498549021780491, 0.04460944980382919, 0.027707012370228767, -0.024263542145490646, -0.04984363168478012, -0.024630742147564888, -0.06502529233694077, -0.0137067511677742, -0.011647392064332962, -5.849745939485729E-4, -0.002295123878866434, -0.03513217344880104, 0.011675044894218445, -0.012409745715558529, -0.031572818756103516, 0.013879140838980675, -0.013079065829515457, 0.059593454003334045, -0.04764040932059288, -0.058427345007658005, -0.03051086701452732, -0.03859064728021622, -0.05336645990610123, -0.017877081409096718, 0.006536487024277449, 0.052518848329782486, -0.024340910837054253, 0.029383376240730286, 0.024626096710562706, -0.020522374659776688, -0.030484849587082863, -