artian year in days ?  \n$$v^2 = \\frac{2GM}{R} \\left( \\frac{4}{5} - \\frac{1}{2} \\right)$$  \n$$v = \\left( \\frac{3 G M}{5 R} \\right)^{1/2}$$  \nA point to note is that the speed of the projectile is zero at N, but is nonzero when it strikes the heavier sphere 4 *M*. The calculation of this speed is left as an exercise to the students.", chunk_id:"e97522b63b642a4cae2a9ef8f3146b7f", next_chunk_id:"de4f54616fddd8c4a9a4b849fcd2dce5"}}, {_id:841, properties:{text_embedding:[-0.024150291457772255, 0.01387693639844656, -0.04646958410739899, 0.027197256684303284, -0.028743240982294083, -0.020446164533495903, -0.031065694987773895, 0.007961101830005646, -0.038468360900878906, -0.0034596947953104973, -0.03994084894657135, 0.010341355577111244, -0.0161419827491045, -0.00862700492143631, 6.548710516653955E-4, 0.039608631283044815, 0.007602417375892401, 0.03304643556475639, 0.056338630616664886, -0.006610395386815071, -0.014657759107649326, 0.014671310782432556, 0.030518565326929092, -0.017173588275909424, 0.0039730495773255825, 0.026593172922730446, -0.0436677411198616, 0.05047069489955902, 0.010805592872202396, 0.02425568178296089, -0.003077405272051692, -0.03435497358441353, 0.04787655547261238, -0.018485350534319878, -0.05380646884441376, 1.1384878598619252E-4, -0.013598056510090828, -0.03905746340751648, -0.022024940699338913, 0.031960759311914444, -0.05942266061902046, -0.0711030513048172, -0.031055038794875145, -0.002113654976710677, 0.03322922810912132, -0.0483417883515358, -0.044607628136873245, -0.03325061872601509, -0.029900847002863884, -0.055902622640132904, -0.015125042758882046, -0.0062324791215360165, 0.06856439262628555, -0.039400938898324966, 0.011182683520019054, -0.002122162841260433, -2.750020066741854E-4, -0.004572387784719467, -0.02474002167582512, 0.023270949721336365, -0.022218788042664528, 0.04548811912536621, -0.04024086147546768, -0.03266557306051254, -0.007393664214760065, 0.03118373267352581, 0.010839469730854034, -0.016016580164432526, -0.01