 centre of a hemispherical shell of uniform mass density has the direction indicated by the arrow (see Fig 7.11) (i) a, (ii) b, (iii) c, (iv) 0.  \n![](_page_15_Picture_152.jpeg)  \n> **Figure Description (llava:latest):**", chunk_id:"4e629d969989f1acaac75d90802f6173", next_chunk_id:"856dbd65bcf99ae3b99f4b39ed360725"}}, {_id:864, properties:{text_embedding:[-0.029776128008961678, -0.00816284865140915, -0.033921465277671814, -0.016397669911384583, 0.014677143655717373, -0.07746464759111404, 0.002997533418238163, 0.025085100904107094, -0.022459542378783226, -0.002951923059299588, -0.016384443268179893, 0.015961473807692528, 0.006286702584475279, 0.010371987707912922, 0.009072759188711643, 0.02237212471663952, 0.00695989141240716, 0.0368715301156044, 0.0020618971902877092, -0.02163458615541458, -0.02256215736269951, 0.001379753346554935, -0.031233463436365128, 0.018435711041092873, -0.0017915671924129128, 0.01177334412932396, -0.03914886713027954, -0.006368618458509445, -0.009359943680465221, 0.026993241161108017, 0.049577221274375916, -0.008557197637856007, 0.04738182574510574, 0.005560831632465124, -0.038035616278648376, -0.015716591849923134, 0.02017201855778694, -0.037558890879154205, -0.04063677042722702, 0.028718551620841026, -0.023466233164072037, -0.04423947259783745, 0.0356377474963665, -0.04389667510986328, -0.010680139996111393, -0.04815344512462616, -0.024830056354403496, -0.03846639767289162, -0.017598381265997887, -0.04524068161845207, -0.007662350777536631, -0.019389832392334938, 0.002903013490140438, -0.0020663782488554716, -0.01218348927795887, -0.010226216167211533, -0.05932699516415596, -0.031795114278793335, -0.08686500042676926, -0.019632989540696144, -0.03212156519293785, 0.01880270428955555, 0.011492143385112286, -0.07340093702077866, 9.676519548520446E-4, 0.09177789837121964, 0.02296574041247368, 0.00967573281377554, -0.02693946287035942, -0.04646134749054909, -0.018708394840359688, 0.041785210371017456, 0.0281129851937294, -0.01917148567736149,